            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/AdobeStock_637162437.jpg",
            "title": "Remanufactured",
            "text": "<p>Complete teardown and rebuild. Every machine is stripped to bare metal, sanded, repainted, and reassembled with new bearings, belts, and batteries. Parts showing more than 25% wear are replaced. Final inspection confirms like-new mechanical and cosmetic condition. Best for: Commercial gyms, serious home setups, and anyone who wants like-new performance at 40-70% off.\n</p>",
